   "fix": "Add a lemma such as `contMDiffAt_iff_contDiffAt_comp_extend_symm (he : e \u2208 maximalAtlas I n M) (hx : x \u2208 e.source) : ContMDiffAt I \ud835\udcd8(\ud835\udd5c, F) n f x \u2194 ContDiffAt \ud835\udd5c n (f \u2218 (e.extend I).symm) (e.extend I x)`, with no completeness assumption. Derive both directions from its `.1` and `.2`.",
   "issue": "The same six-step rewrite chain (contMDiffWithinAt_iff_source_of_mem_maximalAtlas, preimage_univ, univ_inter, I.range_eq_univ, contMDiffWithinAt_univ, contMDiffAt_iff_contDiffAt) appears in ContMDiffAt.analyticAt_comp_extend_symm and again in the reverse direction of contMDiffAt_omega_iff_analyticAt_of_mem_maximalAtlas (line 149). The fact behind it, that being C^n at x is the same as the chart expression being ContDiffAt there, is never stated as a lemma, and a Mathlib rename would break the chain in two places.",
